{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01和S05这样的短时段里感受文字仍然偏密，即使字号较小、重点已突出，听音乐时也很难逐条读完，X的短词更容易快速扫过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然阅读负担更大，但【】突出关键情节后，普通观众能迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化，而且因果关系和前后转折交代得更清楚。感受部分也不只是堆砌情绪标签，而是把声线、音色、力度、旋律变化与身体感受联系起来，细节更具体，并通过船、水波、摇荡等意象形成贯穿全曲的体验。X的优势是轻巧易扫，但右侧短词之间缺少足够的关系和解释，容易留下零散的感觉，难以充分理解音乐变化与人物心理之间的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0bcbe479-c1b6-492e-bd7b-eee105099139", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T023920990944Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:39:45.723243+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a689e0359c5d6ca45571559912546b2a62ddd87455dd8a4f6fe6e053f6453aec", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool